## 3.0.15 (2026-11-18)

### Notes:

-   Start a new updater signing key. Existing installations must install 3.0.15 manually once before automatic updates resume.

## 3.0.14 (2026-11-18)

### Bugs fixed:

-   Close Windows overlay translation only when clicking outside the overlay, instead of when the window loses focus.
-   Show translating and failed states in the overlay, time out unresponsive translation channels, and report the channel, error details and troubleshooting steps.
-   Do not cache empty translation results, so refreshing the overlay requests them again.

## 3.0.13 (2026-11-18)

### New features:

-   Allow choosing the OCR engine used by Windows overlay translation.
-   Keep the overlay window at the selected region size and fit translated text within each OCR box.
-   Use a single selection-sized translation block when the chosen OCR engine does not return text boxes.

## 3.0.12 (2026-11-18)

### Bugs fixed:

-   Fix the translate window rendering an empty transparent frame because `TargetArea` crashed on an undefined `useAtom`.
-   Show a readable message instead of a blank window when a window fails to render.
-   Keep loading the remaining plugins when one plugin fails to load.

## 3.0.11 (2026-11-18)

### Bugs fixed:

-   Point the About page GitHub, issue and discussion links at this repository.

## 3.0.10 (2026-11-18)

### Bugs fixed:

-   Show the translate window from the backend so a missed frontend event can no longer leave it hidden.
-   Keep the translate window inside the current monitor when the saved position is off-screen.
-   Keep the screenshot overlay open on an accidental click instead of closing it as a too-small selection.

## 3.0.9 (2026-11-17)

### Bugs fixed:

-   Register every global shortcut even when one is already taken by another application.
-   Skip clipboard monitoring for empty or overly long text.
-   Skip the translate window when there is no text to translate.

## 3.0.8 (2026-11-17)

### New features:

-   Add Windows overlay translation with OCR-backed text replacement.
-   Add OpenAI-compatible endpoint presets and model selection for overlay translation.

### Bugs fixed:

-   Improve screenshot translation capture and window activation.
-   Prevent long overlay translations and adjacent text boxes from being clipped.
-   Improve configuration window resizing, shortcut field sizing, and control borders.
-   Because this release starts a new updater signing key, existing installations must install 3.0.8 manually once before automatic updates resume.

## 3.0.7 (2025-5-10)

### New feature:

-   signed macOS app

### Bugs fixed:

-   fix screenshot on macOS
-   rm tray click event on macOS
